# civil-holidays v1
# jurisdiction: TW
# source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_holidays_in_Taiwan
#   Structure and dates derived from vacanza/holidays 0.101 (MIT)
#   (github.com/vacanza/holidays), an independent open-source reference
#   maintained against each country's official calendar. Primary names are
#   the jurisdiction's own official-language rendering as vacanza publishes
#   it; English lands only in translations.tab, never in this column.
#   Movable lunar-calendar holidays (Lunar New Year's Eve, Spring Festival,
#   Dragon Boat Festival, Mid-Autumn Festival) with no closed-form rule
#   modelled here are captured as 'decree' (explicit per-year dates, basis
#   tabulated) for 2024-2025. Confucius's Birthday, Taiwan Retrocession Day
#   and Constitution Day were only present in vacanza's 2025 data (not
#   2024), so they are decreed for 2025 only -- an honest single-year gap
#   rather than a fabricated 2024 date. Compensatory workday-bridge
#   ("補假"/"補班") entries are dropped as out of scope.
# retrieved: 2026-07-22
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school (+ vacanza-parity labels, see below)
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed | valid | span
#
fixed         | 中華民國開國紀念日                           | 1 1 | public          |  |  |  |
decree        | 農曆除夕                                | 2024-2-9 2025-1-28  | public          |  |  |  |
